    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE THE CURSED DUNGEON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>The Dark Crown: Genesis</i>, you are thrown into a dungeon ruled by ancient demonic forces. Equipped with the forbidden Element of Darkness, you must fight through relentless enemies and overcome powerful demon bosses to claim their dark powers, weapons, and forge your path to freedom.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273960/extras/b9b384157d2b5b76e24f1e13141abca4.poster.avif?t=1746874146\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273960/extras/b9b384157d2b5b76e24f1e13141abca4.webm?t=1746874146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273960/extras/b9b384157d2b5b76e24f1e13141abca4.mp4?t=1746874146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONQUER THE DARK ELEMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each demon boss embodies a dark element\u2014void, shadow, chaos, oblivion, and pure darkness. By defeating them, you can steal their elemental powers and unique weapons to reshape your combat style. Along the way, confront elemental generals, whose distinct weapons become yours to wield.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273960/extras/ba1d44e43199a664eb324a57d6a7c70c.poster.avif?t=1746874146\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273960/extras/ba1d44e43199a664eb324a57d6a7c70c.webm?t=1746874146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273960/extras/ba1d44e43199a664eb324a57d6a7c70c.mp4?t=1746874146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HANDCRAFTED AND PROCEDURAL DUNGEONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a dungeon that combines meticulously designed areas with procedurally generated maps. Each run is unpredictable, offering unique enemy encounters and environmental challenges that keep every attempt fresh and engaging. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273960/extras/9630a06e561bc3d7281db9ac8a391116.poster.avif?t=1746874146\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273960/extras/9630a06e561bc3d7281db9ac8a391116.webm?t=1746874146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273960/extras/9630a06e561bc3d7281db9ac8a391116.mp4?t=1746874146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEARN THROUGH DEATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each defeat is a lesson. With rogue-lite progression systems, you gain permanent upgrades and unlock new strategies to take on the dungeon\u2019s evolving threats. <br><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAYTEST  AVAILABLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Dark Crown: Genesis</i> is preparing for its early-access with an available  playtest. Help shape the game\u2019s future by exploring its mechanics, fighting its bosses, and sharing your feedback.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE THE CURSED DUNGEON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>The Dark Crown: Genesis</i>, you are thrown into a dungeon ruled by ancient demonic forces. Equipped with the forbidden Element of Darkness, you must fight through relentless enemies and overcome powerful demon bosses to claim their dark powers, weapons, and forge your path to freedom.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273960/extras/b9b384157d2b5b76e24f1e13141abca4.poster.avif?t=1746874146\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273960/extras/b9b384157d2b5b76e24f1e13141abca4.webm?t=1746874146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273960/extras/b9b384157d2b5b76e24f1e13141abca4.mp4?t=1746874146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONQUER THE DARK ELEMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each demon boss embodies a dark element\u2014void, shadow, chaos, oblivion, and pure darkness. By defeating them, you can steal their elemental powers and unique weapons to reshape your combat style. Along the way, confront elemental generals, whose distinct weapons become yours to wield.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273960/extras/ba1d44e43199a664eb324a57d6a7c70c.poster.avif?t=1746874146\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273960/extras/ba1d44e43199a664eb324a57d6a7c70c.webm?t=1746874146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273960/extras/ba1d44e43199a664eb324a57d6a7c70c.mp4?t=1746874146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HANDCRAFTED AND PROCEDURAL DUNGEONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a dungeon that combines meticulously designed areas with procedurally generated maps. Each run is unpredictable, offering unique enemy encounters and environmental challenges that keep every attempt fresh and engaging. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273960/extras/9630a06e561bc3d7281db9ac8a391116.poster.avif?t=1746874146\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273960/extras/9630a06e561bc3d7281db9ac8a391116.webm?t=1746874146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273960/extras/9630a06e561bc3d7281db9ac8a391116.mp4?t=1746874146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEARN THROUGH DEATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each defeat is a lesson. With rogue-lite progression systems, you gain permanent upgrades and unlock new strategies to take on the dungeon\u2019s evolving threats. <br><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAYTEST  AVAILABLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Dark Crown: Genesis</i> is preparing for its early-access with an available  playtest. Help shape the game\u2019s future by exploring its mechanics, fighting its bosses, and sharing your feedback.</p>",
    "short_description": "A pixel-perfect rogue-lite where darkness becomes your greatest weapon. Sacrificed by your kingdom, you awaken in the depths of the endless cursed dungeon. Defeat powerful Demons, claim their elements, and rise through.",
